  $n=15$, \textbf{drawn} at $n=16$}]{8}{Ka1 Qg1 kc1 rd1}\hfill
\sbpos[under={\fray{3}{3}{3}{1}{kqkk}\fray{3}{3}{5}{1}{kqkk}},
